The goal of this EDA to is answer some of the questions relative to trends focusing on number of orders or total cost of freight.\
\
Tools Used: Google Big Query\
\
The Dataset are composed of the ff files:\
Orders\
Categories\
Customers\
Product\
Order Details\
Shippers\
\
Note: \
\
These brief EDA was made into the condition that the dataset doesn\'92t need data cleaning.\
Some of the skills used are: Joins, Date_trunc, Round, Limit, Offset, DateDiff, Countif, Min & Max\
\
\
## How many products do we have each Categories? (Also get the average unit price each categories\
\
SELECT \
\
ct.categoryName as Category,\
COUNT(productID) as Product_Count,\
ROUND(AVG(unitPrice),1) as Ave_Unit_Price\
\
FROM `Northwind_Traders.products` as pr\
\
LEFT JOIN `Northwind_Traders.categories` as ct\
ON pr.categoryID = ct.categoryID\
\
WHERE pr.discontinued = 0\
\
GROUP BY 1\
ORDER BY 2 DESC\
\
\
### Determine the top 5 companies with the most orders\
SELECT \
\
cs.company_name as company,\
count(orders.freight) as order_count\
\
\
FROM `Northwind_Traders.orders` as orders\
\
LEFT JOIN `Northwind_Traders.Customer` as cs\
ON orders.customerID = cs.customer_id\
\
GROUP BY 1\
ORDER BY 2 DESC\
LIMIT 5\
